                <div class="example-box"><div class="example-title">😨 紧张危险</div>情绪效价: <strong>-4</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; 唤醒度: <strong>5</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; 置信度: <strong>5</strong></div>
                <div class="example-box"><div class="example-title">😌 温暖平静</div>情绪效价: <strong>+4</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; 唤醒度: <strong>2</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; 置信度: <strong>5</strong></div>
                
                <button id="startTaskBtn" class="btn-primary" style="width:100%; margin-top:20px;">✅ 开始正式评分</button>
